When using Figma MCP, pass this file (or a frame URL with `node-id`) so tools target the right document.

## Workflow

**A — Library in Figma:** Use official Figma MCP (`use_figma` with `figma-use` skill). Build variables from `design-tokens.json`, then components (spine, panels, dock, nodes) that reference those variables. Prefer incremental `use_figma` calls; return node IDs after creates.

**B — Token parity:** After changing `design-tokens.css`, update `design-tokens.json` and the matching Figma variable collection. Do not duplicate one-off hex values in new CSS — add a token first.

## Skills

- `figma-use` before any `use_figma` call.
- `figma-generate-library` when creating or restructuring variables / design-system pages in Figma from the codebase.
